ner\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/N9E3iZ2.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18054040\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/27cb2a68c5ceaf8bb1c38221eb8b370a?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ylual\" data-uid=\"379294\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ylual\">ylual</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-06 11:12:38 +08:00\">20h 46m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>哈哈哈 ai 又向人类迈进了一步</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18054058\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9e4f/d89e/496830_normal.png?m=1788317374\" alt=\"momo31\" data-uid=\"496830\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/momo31\">momo31</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-06 11:25:31 +08:00\">20h 33m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>是的，从 Claude sonnet 4.6 就有这个感觉</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18054076\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/8717d53bbdb14a76b94d9b682e3cc206?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"kukakalxh\" data-uid=\"696607\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kukakalxh\">kukakalxh</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-06 11:37:37 +08:00\">20h 21m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>有没有可能是厂商也玩中转站的套路，渗水了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18054098\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/141f86b5cead0224ebc0365353521a26?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"paopjian\" data-uid=\"268237\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/paopjian\">paopjian</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-06 11:47:42 +08:00\">20h 11m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>没毛病, 近 10 天, 测试 opus high| sol high 明显流口水, 指令遵循能力下降, opus 到 max 反而更省 token 了, 但也有点蠢, sol 慢得一逼, 已经不想用了, 干啥都半小时起步</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18054139\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9b42176da61211ae2c9fdf8138822274?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"strobber16\" data-uid=\"382341\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/strobber16\">strobber16</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-06 12:13:57 +08:00\">19h 44m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>一般来说，降噪耳机的用户会觉得刚买的时候降噪效果比较好，用了一段时间后降噪效果下降。然后指责厂商用固件更新劣化旧设备</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18054234\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b0a4/932a/754751_normal.png?m=1786327479\" alt=\"yametee\" data-uid=\"754751\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yametee\">yametee</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-06 13:13:48 +08:00\">18h 45m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>我已经主力退回到 5.6 了，6 的提升和代价不成正比，只有特定活会换 6 了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18054461\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/93100e90064ff70a55a0d430fa2a1249?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ReinXD\" data-uid=\"641437\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ReinXD\">ReinXD</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-06 16:20:32 +08:00\">15h 38m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>就是大模型公司为了节省算力把模型权重从满血换成量化版本，不然根本腾不出卡来训练下一代模型</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18054560\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b2d3/f02a/506371_normal.png?m=1760332680\" alt=\"abc0123xyz\" data-uid=\"506371\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/abc0123xyz\">abc0123xyz</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-06 17:27:56 +08:00\">14h 30m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>首发一周内基本上是满血的，方便评测刷分，然后过一两周新模型再偷偷降智商</p><p>一般还会提前把上一代降智</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18054566\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a1ea/50a0/686650_normal.png?m=1782395608\" alt=\"e23nome\" data-uid=\"686650\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/e23nome\">e23nome</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-06 17:31:41 +08:00\">14h 27m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>就是为了卖给企业，显示能力。个人用户不值一提。</p><p>就像直播间里的榜一榜二和普通观众，区别可大了。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18054575\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0b33/2451/535743_normal.png?m=1787642481\" alt=\"wetalk\" data-uid=\"535743\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wetalk\">wetalk</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-06 17:41:55 +08:00\">14h 16m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>模型能力对普通人就是黑盒，很难直观发现，厂商有没有搞骚操作</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18054583\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3f22/feff/383743_normal.png?m=1778835129\" alt=\"YanSeven\" data-uid=\"383743\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/YanSeven\">YanSeven</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-06 17:48:47 +08:00\">14h 10m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>就跟手机一样，以后消费者将长期怀疑厂商到底有没有云控从而达到强制更新迭代的目的。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18054593\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img 